'''Rampachodavaram revenue division''' (or Rampachodavaram division) is an [[administrative division]] in the [[Polavaram district]] of the [[Indian state]] of [[Andhra Pradesh]]. It is one of the two [[List of revenue divisions in Andhra Pradesh|revenue divisions]] in the district which consists of eleven [[mandals]] under its administration.<ref name="division">{{cite web |title=Districts Reorganization |url=https://english.sakshi.com/news/andhrapradesh/heres-how-new-ap-map-looks-after-districts-reorganization-153041 |access-date=1 May 2022 |archive-date=1 June 2022 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20220601231914/https://english.sakshi.com/news/andhrapradesh/heres-how-new-ap-map-looks-after-districts-reorganization-153041 |url-status=dead }}</ref><ref>{{Cite news |last=Jonathan |first=P. Samuel |date=2022-09-07 |title=Andhra Pradesh: Cabinet clears investment proposals worth ₹1.25 lakh crore |language=en-IN |work=The Hindu |url=https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/andhra-pradesh/andhra-pradesh-cabinet-clears-investment-proposals-worth-125-lakh-crore/article65862971.ece |access-date=2022-09-13 |issn=0971-751X}}</ref> [[Rampachodavaram]] is the divisional headquarters.

==History==
Rampachodavaram revenue division was part of East Godavari district, before the districts were reorganised in 2022.
[[File:Rampachodavaram revenue division in East Godavari district.png|thumb|Rampachodavaram revenue division in erstwhile East Godavari district ]]

